📌 Project Title

Vehicle Rental System – Java Console Application

📖 Description

A console-based Java application that allows users to register, login, book vehicles, and calculate rental charges with proper validation.

🛠 Features

User authentication

Vehicle availability management

Date-based booking

Price calculation

Input validation

🧱 Technologies Used

Java

OOP Concepts

Collections Framework

Date & Time API

▶ How to Run
javac VehicleRentalSystem.java
java VehicleRentalSystem

📂 Folder Structure (Recommended)
VehicleRentalSystem/
│── src/
│   └── VehicleRentalSystem.java
│── README.md
